ars: Medieval Crusades","sourceUrl":"https://store.steampowered.com/app/1925620/","fetchedAt":"2026-10-16T08:19:34.121632+00:00","locales":{"en":{"status":"source","provider":"steam","shortDescription":"New Real Time Strategy Game based on medieval times, where you will control powerful factions and empires, with large-scale epic battles, asymmetric civilizations, unit customization system with RPG elements, dynamic AI, 8K support and much more.","detailedDescription":"Ancient Wars: Medieval Crusades offers a unique experience in the world of RTS, with very fun gameplay and never-before-seen mechanics to give RTS fans what they have searched for years. We will have totally asymmetric civilizations, hundreds of different strategic tactics, player freedom to customize their troops, a complete  RPG and unit experience system, a huge unit and skill tree, and historically epic moments in single player campaigns.\n\nAll these features will be enhanced by a great multiplayer experience with various game modes as well as a large collection of maps inspired by historical locations where to fight your battles, in addition to  ]special maps for competitive multiplayer.\nThe game\nThe game will feature:\n\n• Five asymmetrical factions: Arabs, Crusaders, Byzantine Empire, Mongols and Russians.\n\n• Unit Equipment Customization System\n\n• Colorful and beautiful graphics, with great quality\n\n• Innovative gameplay, never seen before in an RTS\n\n• Three historical campaigns, based on important events of the medieval period\n\n• RPG system for units\n\n• Five different game modes (Classic Skirmish, Conquest, Domination, Imperial and Survival)\n\n• Great Historical Battles for single player, cooperatives and multiplayer\n\n• Singleplayer, co-op and multiplayer challenge maps\n\n• Competitive Multiplayer\n\n• Free Updates and DLC\n\n• Great collection of maps inspired by medieval locations\n\n• Reactive AI whose response depends on your actions as a human player\n\n• Realistic physics never seen in an RTS\n\n• Different Weathers that affect the game\n\n• About 200 special abilities for your heroes, special units, special buildings, etc.\n\n• Unique buildings with special bonuses for each civilization\n\n• Realistic naval combat\n\n• Campaign and Map Editor\n\n• Epic soundtrack inspired by popular movie soundtracks.\n\n• Localization in various languages\n\n• Milita, mercenaries, spies, unique buildings, etc...\n\n• 4K/8K support and 144 FPS","aboutGame":null},"vi":{"status":"pending_translation","provider":null,"shortDescription":null,"detailedDescription":null,"aboutGame":null}},"media":{"images":[{"role":"header","url":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1925620/header.jpg?t=1745587357"},{"role":"capsule","url":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1925620/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1745587357"}],"screenshots":[{"id":0,"thumbnailUrl":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1925620/ss_62ab80715def16b8cfb02c7f3c1de85c517370bf.600x338.jpg?t=1745587357","url":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1925620/ss_62ab80715def16b8cfb02c7f3c1de85c517370bf.1920x1080.jpg?t=1745587357"},{"id":1,"thumbnailUrl":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1925620/ss_ccc2234e028e3794fecdb2fc8118724559aa47d3.600x338.jpg?t=1745587357","url":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1925620/ss_ccc2234e028e3794fecdb2fc8118724559aa47d3.1920x1080.jpg?t=1745587357"},{"id":2,"thumbnailUrl":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1925620/ss_14928248f68697269dfcdccc40f7fdcdf43a2704.600x338.jpg?t=1745587357","url":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1925620/ss_14928248f68697269dfcdccc40f7fdcdf43a2704.1920x1080.jpg?t=1745587357"},{"id":3,"thumbnailUrl":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1925620/ss_49a21561c2da4eca4f4f0